Package: nvidia-legacy-173xx-driver
Architecture: amd64
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 nvidia-legacy-173xx-driver-libs (= ${binary:Version}),
 nvidia-legacy-173xx-driver-bin (= ${binary:Version}),
 nvidia-legacy-173xx-kernel-support (= ${binary:Version}),
 nvidia-legacy-173xx-kernel-${kernel:Flavour} | nvidia-legacy-173xx-kernel-dkms,
Recommends:
 libgl1-nvidia-legacy-173xx-glx,
 xorg-server-legacy-nvidia-19,
Provides: nvidia-legacy-driver
Conflicts: nvidia-driver, nvidia-legacy-driver
Replaces: nvidia-legacy-driver
Description: NVIDIA legacy 173.14.39 driver metapackage (GeForce FX 5xxx series (NV3x))
 The 173.14.39 driver from the NVIDIA 173xx legacy series, repackaged as a
 reproducible build for jammy.
 .
 Supported hardware: GeForce FX 5xxx series (NV3x).
 .
 UPSTREAM STATUS: Upstream EOL 2013. Forward-port target kernel 6.12 LTS / xserver ABI 19.
 .
 SECURITY WARNING: this driver series receives NO security updates from NVIDIA
 and has publicly known, unpatched vulnerabilities. Install it only on isolated
 or offline systems, or where the hardware leaves no supported alternative.
 debconf shows this warning again at install time.
 .
 This package is BEST-EFFORT for ubuntu2204: the shipped X server ABI
 (25) is newer than what this driver officially supports
 (19). IgnoreABI is enabled automatically. Test before relying on it.

Package: nvidia-legacy-173xx-driver-libs
Architecture: amd64 i386
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Provides: nvidia-legacy-173xx-driver-libs-nonglvnd
Description: NVIDIA legacy 173.14.39 driver — core runtime libraries
 Shared libraries used by the NVIDIA 173.14.39 driver: libnvidia-glcore,
 libnvidia-tls, libnvidia-eglcore and friends. Install the :i386 variant
 alongside for 32-bit OpenGL applications.

Package: nvidia-legacy-173xx-driver-bin
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: NVIDIA legacy 173.14.39 driver — utilities
 nvidia-smi, nvidia-settings' backend, nvidia-xconfig, nvidia-debugdump and
 the nvidia-persistenced daemon for the 173.14.39 driver.

