Package: nvidia-legacy-173xx-kernel-support
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Provides: nvidia-legacy-173xx-kernel-support-nonglvnd
Description: NVIDIA legacy 173.14.39 driver — kernel/X integration glue
 Ships the nouveau blacklist, the modprobe alias, the initramfs hook, the udev
 rules and the /etc/X11/xorg.conf.d snippet for the 173.14.39 driver.

Package: nvidia-legacy-173xx-kernel-6.8.0-45-generic
Architecture: amd64
Section: non-free/kernel
