Description: NVIDIA legacy 173xx prebuilt module for Linux 6.8.0-45-generic
 The nvidia/-modeset/-drm/-uvm modules from the 173xx series,
 compiled for the 6.8.0-45-generic kernel ABI. No toolchain needed on the target.
